       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MR-ELASTO.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MR-ELASTO-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SHEAR-DISPLACE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VISCO-MODULI-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ARTIFACT-ISOLATE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MRE-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MRE-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MR-ELASTO-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PME-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PME-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SHEAR-AND-MODULI.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PME-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SHEAR-AND-MODULI.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHEAR-DISPLACE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VISCO-MODULI-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ARTIFACT-ISOLATE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MRE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PME-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SHEAR-DISPLACE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-VISCO-MODULI-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ARTIFACT-ISOLATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MRE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MRE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PME-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PME-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PME-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PME-CODE.
